{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-04",
  "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "更小的架构假设空间可以排除大量与任务结构不符的映射；前提是它仍包含真实解。讲义同时提醒，易优化、可并行和 GPU 效率也是好架构的条件。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 6
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "语义分割给每个像素分配类别。若小块缺少识别上下文，可用较大且重叠的块，在保持密集输出的同时看到更多邻域。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 18
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 19
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 22
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "对每个位置施加同一局部规则时，输入移动会使输出以相同方式移动。这里应称等变，而不是把输出理解为保持不变。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 23
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 36
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "局部连接假设一个输出仅依赖邻域；在所有位置复用同一组局部权重，就得到卷积网络。受约束的线性结构使用更少参数。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 27
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 28
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "同一操作可以看作平移等变映射、滑窗块处理、图像滤波、参数共享，或处理可变尺寸张量的方法。这五种视角分别强调行为、计算和表示。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 34
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 36
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "堆叠局部卷积后，深层位置依赖更大的输入区域；逐点非线性不扩大感受野，而下采样会让后续位置对应更大的原图范围。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 37
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 62
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "跨空间池化可增强对小平移的容忍；步幅操作把卷积或池化与下采样合并，减少空间尺寸但可能造成混叠；扩张卷积把核采样点拉开，以较少参数覆盖更大感受野。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 52
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 58
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 59
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 60
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "编码器下采样形成压缩表示，解码器上采样得到空间输出。U-Net 的镜像跳跃连接把早期高分辨率激活拼接到后期层，以恢复细节。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 67
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 68
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 70
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 71
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ResNet 的跳跃路径与块输出相加，使块学习对输入的修正；维度不同时可先线性映射。它与 U-Net 跨尺度拼接的连接目的和融合方式不同。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 71
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "当任务需要绝对位置时，可以换用非平移不变架构，或把位置信息加入卷积输入。神经场则以连续坐标为输入，返回颜色或体密度等场值。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 76
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 77
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 78
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 79
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "8bddd7b92da432811bc972659dac450d5086b96bf5fa4ef7d0cc018e24049463",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-04-slides",
          "page": 80
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "formulas": [],
  "objectives": [
    "用假设空间解释架构归纳偏置与数据效率之间的关系。",
    "由语义分割的重叠局部预测，说明卷积的局部性、权重共享和平移等变性。",
    "从五种互补视角描述卷积层，并解释其对可变尺寸网格的适用性。",
    "分析堆叠卷积、池化、步幅与扩张对感受野、分辨率和计算的影响。",
    "比较编码器—解码器、U-Net、ResNet，以及位置编码与神经场的作用边界。"
  ],
